OL,3,GNEWSARail line reopens after Didcot gas
OL,4,Aleak fixed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains are running again after a gas
OL,7,Fleak closed the line between Didcot
OL,8,FParkway and Reading.
OL,10,FAn exclusion zone was in place on
OL,11,FWednesday while engineers from gas
OL,12,Fdistribution firm SGN fixed the gas
OL,13,Fleak with rail travellers urged not to
OL,14,Ftravel between Reading in Berkshire and
OL,15,FSwindon in Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
