OL,3,GNEWSARail line reopens after Didcot gas
OL,4,Aleak fixed
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail said most services should
OL,7,Fbe back to normal on Thursday but some
OL,8,Fshort-notice changes were still
OL,9,Fpossible as GWR works to fully restore
OL,10,Fnormal operations across the network.
OL,11,FTravellers are urged to check their
OL,12,Fjourney before travelling.
OL,14,FTickets for travel on services affected
OL,15,Fthat were not used on Wednesday can be
OL,16,Fused on Thursday or refunded.
